 <h3><u>Mujhe maulai banana</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Aise parwan chadhana<br> mujhe maulai banana, aye meri maa</p> 
  <p>Mujhko dena ye khazana<br> mujhe maulai banana, aye meri maa</p> 
  <p>1. Maa mujhe khoob padhana, aur namazi bhi banana..(2)<br> aur tabarra bhi sikhana<br> mujhe maulai banana, aye meri maa</p> 
  <p>2. Kar du duniya ko mai qaael, aise maula ke fazael..(2)<br> mujhe lori me sunana<br> mujhe maulai banana, aye meri maa</p> 
  <p>3. Maa mujhe jab bhi sulana, marsiye nauhe sunana..(2)<br> Ya Ali kehke jagana<br> mujhe maulai banana, aye meri maa</p> 
  <p>4. Aaye jab aath moharram, to mere waaste paiham..(2)<br> ek alam ghar me sajana<br> mujhe maulai banana, aye meri maa</p> 
  <p>5. Mana hai umr abhi kam, maa mujhe karna hai matam..(2)<br> mujhe zanjeer dilana<br> mujhe maulai banana, aye meri maa</p> 
  <p>6. Mujhko jo khana khilana, thanda pani jo pilana..(2)<br> karbala yaad dilana<br> mujhe maulai banana, aye meri maa</p> 
  <p>7. Zikr e sarwar ho mera kaam, gunje duniya me mera naam..(2)<br> nauhakhwan mujhko banana<br> mujhe maulai banana, aye meri maa</p> 
  <p>8. Jo wila se mujhe roke, jo aza pe mujhe toke..(2)<br> aise logo se bachana<br> mujhe maulai banana, aye meri maa</p> 
  <p>9. Aaye jab aisa zamana, jab mere sehra sajana..(2)<br> nauha akbar ka padhana<br> mujhe maulai banana, aye meri maa</p> 
  <p>10. Ye nahi maa ko nasihat, ye hai bus joshe aqeedat..(2)<br> iska maqsad hai batana<br> mujhe maulai banana, aye meri maa</p> 
  <p>11. Hai khuda se yahi hajat, rakh meri maa ko salamat..(2)<br> jisne is baat ko maana<br> mujhe maulai banana, aye meri maa</p> 
  <p>12. Manqabat zille raza ki, ye jo farha ne sunayi..(2)<br> ye hai bachpan ka tarana<br> mujhe maulai banana, aye meri maa..(3)</p> 
